1584-        "edge_* tests cover `.restore` of an unknown name, `.checkpoint` with a duplicate name (refused, old one kept — never silent overwrite), undo across 50 bindings (stack bounded, oldest dropped with a notice, never unbounded growth), and `.redo` after a new change (redo stack cleared, stated in the message)"
